# Homepage last-updated date

Whenever you change site content or layout (e.g. `index.md`, `_includes/*`, `_layouts/homepage.html`, `_data/*`, `_config.yml`), also update the footer date in `_layouts/homepage.html`:

```html
&copy; Linxiao Cao | Last updated: Mon D, YYYY
```

Use the actual change date (e.g. `Aug 6, 2026`). Do this in the same edit/commit as the content change.
